---

**Segment Notes:**

This segment documents the complete V2 development cycle for Star Sailors (August-October 2025). The platform successfully launched with:

- **Multiple Classification Projects:** Planet Hunters, Disk Detective, AI4Mars, Active Asteroids, Cloudspotting, NGTS lightcurves, Sunspots
- **Real Astronomical Data Integration:** TIC/KOI datasets, NGTS lightcurves, exoplanet data
- **Citizen Science Mechanics:** One-click classification, achievements system, milestones tracking
- **Research & Progression:** Stardust economy, tech tree, mineral deposits, inventory management
- **Mobile Integration:** React Native/Expo setup for future mobile apps
- **Bumble Integration:** Bee classification minigame, almanac system, plot management

**Total Tasks Completed:** 158 tasks across 4 months of development
